---
title: "decryptSealedBid (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_key: caller invokes decryptSealedBid(encryptedAmountOut, salt)
    q_check_key --> q_revert_key: privateKey not yet published
    q_revert_key --> [*]: revert PrivateKeyNotReleased
    q_check_key --> q_decrypt: privateKey published
    q_decrypt --> q_validate: decrypt encryptedAmountOut using privateKey and salt
    q_validate --> [*]: return decryptedAmount

    note right of q_decrypt
        INV-001: Decryption is a public view function available after private key release
        INV-002: Salt must match the investor address used during encryption
        INV-003: Enables public auditability of all sealed bids
    end note
